            "review_title": "Review at Doumer Craft Beer Vietnam",
            "review_text": "okspurr\nSheffield, United Kingdom63 contributions\n0\nDoumer Craft Beer, Hidden Gem\nMar 2025 • Couples\nA hidden Gem. \nWe were struggling to find a “Pub” in Hà Nội. Everywhere are coffee shops. We went around the Lake instead of the busy town and what a breath of fresh air it was. Only £2 in a taxi… Use Grab app. \nHubby was addicted to Passion Fruit beer and for me it was the strawberry beer. The Vietnamese are very trying, helpful people. They know the tourists are wanting a beer so most are just starting out. \nI would highly recommend this bar, they also serve food which too looked good. \nStaff very helpful and attentive ❤️\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 4, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
