            "review_title": "Review at Doumer Craft Beer Vietnam",
            "review_text": "vincent m\nLiverpool, United Kingdom65 contributions\n0\nGreat Little Real Beer Find, Well Recommended, not to be missed.\nNov 2024 • Couples\nWhat a great find this little gem was, beautiful IPA on draught and other craft beers including Ciders (a very good Guinness tasting brew as well) brewed by Effy's uncle. Effy is a beautiful local lady who has took on this adventure and is the complete host who welcomes you with open arms and a big smile to become friends immediately, always a snack or fruit on the table when you order a drink, the smoked cheese was amazing, her hospitality was brilliant, her knowledge her help and advice were impeccable and the beers are excellent.\nI advise anyone who likes craft beers to make a point of going to Effy's Doumer Craft Beer. No matter where you are staying in Hanoi just get a Grab Taxi(so cheap, so download the App) to there as it is well worth it.\nThank you Effy for your brilliant hospitality.\nBest of luck and love for the future,\nAlso to Whan who had only just started to work there but had took to his job like a duck to water, good luck to you for your future.\n\nThanks again, forever friends we hope to see you again one day.\n\nVinny and Candy xx Liverpool, England.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 24, 2024",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
